Repository compiles. Now step 4: service layer. First extend RaceService interface, then implement in RaceServiceImpl, then controller, then the "申诉中" flag on leaderboard + seal gate.

Interface additions:

```java
/** 提交处罚申诉：受理并冻结处罚、成绩、分段判定与榜单版本，状态PENDING。 */
