```

Wait — no version bump on accept. But hold on: `requireOpenRace` checks race.version == expectedVersion. Since accept doesn't bump, subsequent operations use same version. OK.

Hmm, one issue: H2 unique constraint names. uk_appeal_penalty is a named unique constraint → H2 exception message includes constraint name uppercase "UK_APPEAL_PENALTY". PK violation message includes "PK_APPEAL"? For PK on appeal_key, H2 generates constraint name "PK_APPEAL"? Actually for `CONSTRAINT pk_appeal PRIMARY KEY`, the name is pk_appeal. Duplicate appealKey → pk violation mentioning PK_APPEAL. Existing code uses constraintMatches(ex, "pk_checkpoint_timing"). So I can distinguish: uk_appeal_penalty → "该处罚已存在申诉"; else (pk_appeal) → "appealKey已存在".

**recommendAppeal:**
```java
return withIdempotency(request.requestId(), "RECOMMEND_APPEAL",
    orderedParams("raceId", raceId, "appealKey", appealKey, "officialId", ..., "decision", ..., "replacementMs", ...),
    () -> {
        RaceRow race = repository.findRaceForUpdate(raceId).orElseThrow(NotFound);
        if (race.status() == SEALED) throw new ConflictException("赛事已封榜");
        AppealRow appeal = repository.findAppealForUpdate(appealKey).orElseThrow(NotFound "申诉不存在");
        if (!appeal.raceId().equals(raceId)) throw new NotFoundException("申诉不属于该赛事");
        if (appeal.status() != PENDING) throw new ConflictException("申诉已裁决");
        if (appeal.firstOfficialId() != null) throw new ConflictException("已有待确认的第一人建议");
        AppealDecision decision = parseDecision(request.decision());
        Long replacementMs = request.replacementMs();
        validateRecommendation(decision, replacementMs); // REPLACE requires non-null >=0 <=MAX; others require null → 400
        long now = clock.millis();
        int updated = repository.recordFirstOpinion(appealKey, officialId, decision.name(), replacementMs, now);
        if (updated == 0) throw new ConflictException("申诉状态已变化");
        return ServiceResult.ok(toAppealResponse(repository.findAppeal(appealKey).orElseThrow()));
    });
```

Should recommend validate replacementMs <= MAX_PENALTY_MS? Spec: "非负替代罚时". I'll validate >= 0 (bean validation @PositiveOrZero) and <= MAX_PENALTY_MS (1h) → 400 BadRequest for out of range, consistent with addPenalty style. Hmm, addPenalty uses 1..3600000. For replacement, 0 allowed. I'll do 0..3600000 → BadRequestException otherwise.

**confirmAppeal:**
```java
return withIdempotency(request.requestId(), "CONFIRM_APPEAL",
    orderedParams("raceId", raceId, "appealKey", appealKey, "officialId", ..., "action", ..., "decision", ..., "replacementMs", ...),
    () -> {
        RaceRow race = repository.findRaceForUpdate(raceId).orElseThrow(NotFound);
        if (race.status() == SEALED) throw new ConflictException("赛事已封榜，禁止裁决");
        AppealRow appeal = repository.findAppealForUpdate(appealKey).orElseThrow(NotFound);
        if (!appeal.raceId().equals(raceId)) throw NotFound;
        if (appeal.status() != PENDING) throw new ConflictException("申诉已裁决");
        if (appeal.firstOfficialId() == null) throw new ConflictException("尚无第一人建议，不能确认或驳回");
        ConfirmAction action = parseConfirmAction(request.action());
        if (request.officialId().equals(appeal.firstOfficialId()))
            throw new UnprocessableEntityException("第二名裁决人不能与第一人相同");
        if (action == REJECT) {
            if (request.decision() != null || request.replacementMs() != null)
                throw new BadRequestException("驳回不得携带建议内容");
            int updated = repository.rejectFirstOpinion(appealKey, officialId, now);
            if (updated == 0) throw new ConflictException("申诉状态已变化");
            return ServiceResult.ok(toAppealResponse(...));
        }
        // CONFIRM
        AppealDecision decision = parseDecision(request.decision());  // null → 400
        validateRecommendation(decision, request.replacementMs());
        if (!decision.name().equals(appeal.firstDecision())
            || !Objects.equals(request.replacementMs(), appeal.firstReplacementMs()))
            throw new UnprocessableEntityException("第二人只能确认与第一人完全相同的建议");
        // 版本校验：重新读取处罚、计时与分段版本（赛事版本覆盖计时/分段/处罚变更）
        if (race.version() != appeal.leaderboardVersion())
            throw new ConflictException("受理后赛事版本已变化，禁止裁决");
        PenaltyRow penalty = repository.findPenalty(appeal.penaltyId()).orElseThrow();
        if (penalty.version() != appeal.penaltyVersion() || penalty.revoked())
            throw new ConflictException("受理后处罚版本已变化，禁止裁决");
        // 重算前榜单
        List<RunnerRow> runners = ...; penalties; checkpoints; timings;
        List<ResultEntry> beforeEntries = ResultCalculator.compute(...);
        // 应用裁决
        long now = clock.millis();
        switch (decision) {
            case UPHOLD -> {}
            case REMOVE -> {
                int u = repository.markPenaltyRevoked(penalty.penaltyId(), now);
                if (u == 0) throw new ConflictException("处罚状态已变化");
            }
            case REPLACE -> {
                int u = repository.replacePenaltyVersion(penalty.penaltyId(), replacementMs, appeal.penaltyVersion());
                if (u == 0) throw new ConflictException("处罚版本已变化");
                repository.insertPenaltyRevision(new PenaltyRevisionRow(
                    penalty.penaltyId(), penalty.version(), penalty.type(), penalty.amountMs(),
                    penalty.version() + 1, appealKey, now));
            }
        }
        // 重算后榜单
        List<PenaltyRow> penaltiesAfter = repository.findPenalties(raceId);
        List<ResultEntry> afterEntries = ResultCalculator.compute(runners, penaltiesAfter, checkpoints, timings);
        // 推进榜单版本（恰好一次）
        int newVersion = appeal.leaderboardVersion() + 1;
        int bumped = repository.bumpVersionIfOpen(raceId, appeal.leaderboardVersion());
        if (bumped == 0) throw new ConflictException("版本冲突或赛事已封榜");
        AppealStatus newStatus = switch(decision){UPHOLD->UPHELD; REMOVE->REMOVED; REPLACE->REPLACED};
        String beforeJson = writeJson(beforeEntries.stream().map(ResponseMapper::toEntryResponse).toList());
        String afterJson = writeJson(afterEntries...);
        int done = repository.completeAppealDecision(appealKey, newStatus.name(), officialId, decision.name(), replacementMs, now, beforeJson, afterJson, newVersion);
        if (done == 0) throw new ConflictException("申诉状态已变化");
        return ServiceResult.ok(toAppealResponse(repository.findAppeal(appealKey).orElseThrow()));
    });
```

Wait — bumpVersionIfOpen also checks status OPEN; we hold the race lock and checked OPEN, fine. Note ordering: apply penalty change then bump. If bump fails, transaction rolls back including penalty change. Atomic ✓.

Note: `markPenaltyRevoked` bumps penalty version too — that's fine, it's part of the decision.

